    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42325" root="ولب" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْلَبُ</span></b> : see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلب</span>. Accord. to Suh, the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span>
is substituted for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>, and the word is derived
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">والية</span>, the “ offsets of corn and the like: ”
and Ibn-'Osfoor and IKtt assert the same.
(TA.)

